# Assassin's Trophy: "Destroy target permanent an opponent controls. Its controller may search their library for a basic land
# card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle." Bot1 may not target its own Mox Jet (a refusal beside the positive
# control, Bot2's Llanowar Elves). The Elves die; Bot2, their controller, accepts, may not take the nonbasic Tundra and takes
# a Swamp, which enters untapped (the card says nothing of tapped).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Assassin's Trophy
Plains x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x6
Tundra
Swamp
Forest x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Assassin's Trophy.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
Bot1.Hand.Assassin's Trophy.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Accept
! Bot2.Search(Tundra)
Bot2.Search(Swamp)

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Assassin's Trophy
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Swamp
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Emerald
